{"id":"genannt","lemma":"genannt","pos":"adj","rank":1029,"glosses":["called, mentioned, named"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/74/De-genannt.ogg/De-genannt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wie wirst du von anderen genannt?","en":"What do people call you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695065","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"another , others","l":"anderer"},null]},{"text":"Wie haben Sie mich genannt?","en":"What did you call me?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null]},{"text":"Er hat mich einen Feigling genannt.","en":"He called me a coward.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"coward, chicken"},null]},{"text":"Wie möchtest du gerne genannt werden?","en":"What would you like to be called?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"don't mention it"},null,{"g":"to become"}]},{"text":"Ich habe dir den Grund bereits genannt.","en":"I already told you why.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756025","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"ground, land"},{"g":"already"},null]}]}